{"title":"📊 Master Sales Tracker (make a copy)"}
</properties>
<content>
The Grid sales tracker, pre-configured for this offer. Make your own copy and start logging.
**How to use:** open the sheet below, then **File → Make a Copy**, save it to your Drive, share edit access to Daniel, and paste your copy's link here in the teamspace.
[**➡️ Open The Grid Master Sales Tracker**](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1oPo_Sr7wuD6VtyKiF5yWcmWl9Io1bePdmyR8J1irvPE/edit)
## What's inside
- **Follow-Up Pipeline** - chase everyone who hasn't bought yet. Log why they're in follow-up, the objection, deal size, and next follow-up date. Rows due today auto-highlight red.
- **Upsell / Ascension Board** - ascend everyone who HAS bought. Pick their current tier (Manual, Operation Room, Mastermind, Add-On) and the sheet auto-shows the next upsell, price, and when they're due. Manual to Operation Room at 21 days, Operation Room to Mastermind at 45, Mastermind to Add-On at 30.
- **CONFIG tab** - already filled for The Grid (tiers, sources, objections, niches, ascension map). Edit there if anything changes.
</content>
</page>
